  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Overview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Introducing <strong>Better than QBZ-97?</strong> — a by-product of the original <strong>QBZ-97 project</strong>. Imported from the fictional firearms manufacturer <strong>Defense Group</strong> in Call of Duty, this rifle offers a <strong>QBZ-97 replica</strong> with enhanced customization options and a fire mode upgrade to <strong>full-auto</strong>.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/9261-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/9262-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/9262-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/9263-pasted-from-clipboard-png/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/attachment/9263-pasted-from-clipboard-png/?thumbnail=1\" alt=\"?thumbnail=1\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>\n<p>- More customization options than the original QBZ-97.</p>\n<p>- Firemode upgraded to full-auto for maximum effectiveness.</p>\n<p>- Find it and its parts at <strong>Mechanic’s shop</strong> or on the <strong>Flea Market</strong></p>\n<p>Models and textures are properties of <strong>Activision</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Unzip the downloaded files.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the mod folder in to the spt directory.</p>\n<p>3. Launch the game.</p>\n<p>4. Visit <strong>Mechanic’s shop</strong> or the <strong>Flea Market</strong> to find the rifle and its parts.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>When reuploading or sharing this mod</strong>, please clearly indicate the author or source.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Do not distribute files with the <code>.bundle</code> extension</strong> (or its variants) from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- Respect the original creator’s rights as these models and textures are properties of <strong>Activision</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>Original models and textures:</strong> Activision</p>\n<p>- <strong>Special thanks to:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
